B.eFd=new A.dw("q12",B.cr,"","Love one another, but make not a bond of love:\nLet it rather be a moving sea between the shores of your souls.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.zM)
B.eF1=new A.dw("q13",B.cr,"","And stand together yet not too near together:\nFor the pillars of the temple stand apart,\nAnd the oak tree and the cypress grow not in each other\u2019s shadow.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.zM)
B.eEv=new A.dw("q14",B.cr,"","Love gives naught but itself and takes naught but from itself.\nLove possesses not nor would it be possessed;\nFor love is sufficient unto love.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.E6)
B.eER=new A.dw("q15",B.cr,"","Many waters cannot quench love, neither can the floods drown it.","Song of Solomon 8:7, King James Bible (1611)",B.zN)
B.eEz=new A.dw("q16",B.cr,"","Set me as a seal upon thine heart.","Song of Solomon 8:6, King James Bible (1611)",B.t9)
B.eEO=new A.dw("q17",B.cr,"","O my Luve is like a red, red rose\nThat\u2019s newly sprung in June.","Robert Burns, A Red, Red Rose (1794)",B.DW)
